Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `holder` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> take_from_borrowed_parameter_field_is_rejected.jet:11:10
    |
 11 |     grab(^holder.res)
    |          ^
 Why: Read and write parameters and named windows keep ownership with their source
 Fix: Copy the value with `holder.copy()`, or accept it with the move marker `^`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201
